{"id":"curiosidad","lemma":"curiosidad","pos":"noun","rank":1617,"glosses":["curiosity"],"ipa":"/kuɾjosiˈdad/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"curiosidades"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6c/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-curiosidad.wav","examples":[{"text":"La curiosidad mató al gato.","en":"Curiosity killed the cat.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/537847","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to kill, slay","l":"matar"},{"g":"to the"},{"g":"cat"}]},{"text":"Lo hizo simplemente por curiosidad.","en":"He did it simply out of curiosity.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1189063","words":[{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"simply"},{"g":"for / by"},null]},{"text":"Solo tengo curiosidad.","en":"I'm just curious.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/77105","words":[{"g":"sole"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},null]},{"text":"El niño estaba lleno de curiosidad.","en":"The child was full of curiosity.","words":[null,null,{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"full"},{"g":"of / from"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"the Christ child"]]},{"text":"Eso me da curiosidad.","en":"This makes me curious.","words":[{"g":"that","l":"ése"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to give, to give out","l":"dar"},null]}]}